category: X11
build-depends: cygport libdrm-devel libgtest-devel libgtest0 libva-devel libva-drm-devel libva-x11-devel libX11-devel
sdesc: "Collection of tests for VA-API"
ldesc: "libva-utils is a collection of utilities and examples to exercise VA-API in
accordance with the libva project. --enable-tests (default = no) provides a
suite of unit-tests based on Google Test Framework. A driver implementation is
necessary to properly operate."
